                    <p class="text-[12px] text-gray-500 mb-2">2 days ago</p>
                    <p class="text-[15px] font-normal text-gray-300 leading-snug">"Best decision ever! The deals were easy to complete and I got my $100 credit for Halloween costumes instantly."</p>
                </div>

                <div class="bg-gray-800/40 p-5 rounded-2xl border border-gray-700">
                    <div class="flex justify-between items-start mb-1">
                        <p class="text-[16px] font-bold text-white">Michael T.</p>
                        <div class="flex gap-0.5">
                            <svg class="testimonial-star" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 17.27L18.18 21l-1.64-7.03L22 9.24l-7.19-.61L12 2 9.19 8.63 2 9.24l5.46 4.73L5.82 21z"/></svg>
                            <svg class="testimonial-star" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 17.27L18.18 21l-1.64-7.03L22 9.24l-7.19-.61L12 2 9.19 8.63 2 9.24l5.46 4.73L5.82 21z"/></svg>
                            <svg class="testimonial-star" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 17.27L18.18 21l-1.64-7.03L22 9.24l-7.19-.61L12 2 9.19 8.63 2 9.24l5.46 4.73L5.82 21z"/></svg>
